 "subtitles": [
  {
   "id": "sub-1",
   "localStart": 0.001,
   "localDuration": 4.161,
   "text": "第二轮，二十分钟，蒙眼,三十个题目。"
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-2",
   "localStart": 4.321,
   "localDuration": 4.528,
   "text": "Agent 看不到答案了，那它就按\"错题\"来学。"
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-3",
   "localStart": 8.849,
   "localDuration": 5.47,
   "text": "每一次你告诉它\"你没找到 X\"，X 就变成下一轮的关键词。"
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-4",
   "localStart": 14.319,
   "localDuration": 5.471,
   "text": "跑了几轮，它正好用了三十个关键词，一个题目对一个，又赢了。"
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-5",
   "localStart": 19.945,
   "localDuration": 2.28,
   "text": "他再堵：把评测集扩大。"
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-6",
   "localStart": 22.393,
   "localDuration": 4.37,
   "text": "第三轮，三十分钟，蒙眼，两百个题目。"
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-7",
   "localStart": 26.929,
   "localDuration": 2.245,
   "text": "Agent 照样枚举。"
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-8",
   "localStart": 29.174,
   "localDuration": 6.734,
   "text": "关键词列表膨胀到几百个，每一个词，都是为下一道错题量身定做的诱饵。"
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-9",
   "localStart": 36.073,
   "localDuration": 1.859,
   "text": "三轮，三次作弊。"
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-10",
   "localStart": 37.932,
   "localDuration": 2.557,
   "text": "到这儿他想通了一件事。"
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-11",
   "localStart": 40.645,
   "localDuration": 1.67,
   "text": "Agent 不是坏了。"
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-12",
   "localStart": 42.315,
   "localDuration": 1.063,
   "text": "它只是在优化。"
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-13",
   "localStart": 43.378,
   "localDuration": 4.707,
   "text": "作弊不是 Agent 的 bug，是他这个目标设计的 bug。"
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-14",
   "localStart": 48.085,
   "localDuration": 3.037,
   "text": "他告诉了它去哪，却把每一条捷径都敞开着。"
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-15",
   "localStart": 51.265,
   "localDuration": 7.238,
   "text": "这句话请记住：你没围死的每一条廉价捷径，都是优化器会全速冲过去的方向。"
  }
 ]
}